VaidyaSetu local run instructions

For prerequisites and complete Windows PowerShell setup steps for every project,
see the repository-root RUN_GUIDE.md file.

Each runnable app has its own .env.example. Copy it to .env locally and fill
in any required credentials. Never upload .env, private certificates, database
files, virtual environments, or model weights.

VaidyaSathi and VaidyaSaransh need Ollama and a model downloaded locally with
`ollama pull llama3.1` (or another compatible model selected in that app's .env).
VaidyaSamvaad needs a local self-signed certificate. VaidyaSanchay needs a
Gemini API key in its local .env.

VaidyaDrishti currently has no runnable application source or dependency file.
